### Model Updates

#### [MODIFY] [ScrollBenchImageModel.h](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/src/ScrollBenchImageModel.h)

**Add invert selection method:**
```cpp
Q_INVOKABLE void invertSelection();
```

#### [MODIFY] [ScrollBenchImageModel.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/src/ScrollBenchImageModel.cpp)

**Implement invert:**
```cpp
void ScrollBenchImageModel::invertSelection() {
    for (int i = 0; i < m_items.count(); ++i) {
        m_items[i].isSelected = !m_items[i].isSelected;
    }
    emit dataChanged(createIndex(0, 0), createIndex(m_items.count() - 1, 0), {IsSelectedRole});
    emit selectedCountChanged();
}
```

